---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'About Daily Work Hack',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="px-6 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <header class="mb-8 md:mb-12 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter mb-4 font-heading dark:text-gray-200">
        About Daily Work Hack
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400 text-lg">
        Practical AI Tools, Workplace Productivity, and Real-World Automation Workflows
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mx-auto prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        <strong>Daily Work Hack</strong> (<a href="https://work.storydailyview.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">work.storydailyview.com</a>) is an independent technical publication dedicated to delivering practical workplace productivity, no-code automation, and real-world AI implementation solutions.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        We bridge the gap between complex software capabilities and everyday office productivity. Rather than abstract theoretical overviews, our goal is to provide clear, actionable workflows for spreadsheet data modeling, intelligent AI prompts, and repetitive task automation to help professionals resolve workflow bottlenecks quickly and reclaim their time.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">What We Cover</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
        <li>
          <strong>Workplace AI & LLM Workflows:</strong> Practical prompt engineering, generative AI integration for office reporting, and ethical, data-safe AI practices.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Data & Spreadsheet Automation:</strong> Excel Power Query models, Google Sheets advanced functions, dynamic arrays, and cross-platform formula troubleshooting.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Workflow & Process Automation:</strong> Repetitive task elimination, automated report compilation, no-code integrations, and scheduled office routine setups.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Office Software & Tools:</strong> Productivity suites, document pipeline optimization, cloud collaboration tools, and shortcut mastery.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Practical Work & Productivity:</strong> Real-world office case studies, end-of-month data consolidation tips, and time-saving workflows for everyday desk workers.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4">Editorial Standards</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Every automation workflow and technical productivity guide published on Daily Work Hack is verified to ensure data integrity and execution safety. We prioritize user data privacy, reproducible step-by-step methodologies, and non-destructive configurations across all our publications.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
